# name: bt-debug
# Every Bluetooth piece on with its diagnostics (BLE MIDI with bonding, the central at FULL, BLE_DIAG; BT audio with AFH and BT_DIAG), the USB console for the logs (no USB audio: the console takes its endpoints). From release-pass D (2026-10-24); ACID and the help line off to make room.
# release-pass D (optional): A with the serial console and the Bluetooth diagnostics (btpage, btrx) in place of USB audio and the X0X 909 kit, to see AFH act
# firmware builder configuration (tools/builder/registry.py keys; others take their defaults)
